<title>SWITZERLAND: U.S. withdraws bid for WTO panel in EU grain row.</title>
<headline>U.S. withdraws bid for WTO panel in EU grain row.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United States on Thursday withdrew its request for immediate creation of a World Trade Organisation (WTO) panel on in its long-running dispute with the European Union over grain tariffs.</p>
<p>The move was announced at the start of a meeting of the WTO's Dispute Settlement Body (DSB) which had been due to automatically approve creation of a panel after the EU refused to agree at the last session in February.</p>
</text>
